  "body_markdown": "Skip to content\n\nDental Implants\n\nDental Implant Surgery\n\nAll-on-4 Dental Implants\n\nFixed Teeth vs. Removable\n\nCost & Compare\n\nDental Implant FAQ\n\nAesthetics\n\nCosmetic Dentistry\n\nPorcelain Veneers\n\nDental Crowns & Bridges\n\nSmile Makeover\n\nTeeth Whitening\n\nTreatments\n\nSedation Dentistry\n\nOral Surgery\n\nEmergency Dentistry\n\nConditions We Treat\n\nWhat To Expect\n\nPatient Center\n\nInsurance & Financing\n\nSmile Gallery\n\nWho We Are\n\nWhy Choose Us\n\nMeet Dr. Esam Nahlah\n\nMeet The Team\n\nVideo Library\n\nPatient Stories\n\nFor Doctors\n\nReferral Form\n\nContact Us\n\nBlog\n\nCurrent Patients\n\nTysons Corner: (703) 448-3312\n\nAlexandria: (703) 940-5410\n\nNew Patients\n\nTysons Corner: (571) 619-9442\n\nAlexandria: (571) 410-3430\n\nBook now\n\n\n## Book Now\n\n\n\n## Book Now\n\n\n\n## Navigating the World of Dental Implant Surgery in McLean, VA\n\n\nAugust 20, 2024\n\n\n#### Share This Post\n\n\nDental implants have become a popular and reliable solution to tooth loss. Their increasingly widespread use can be attributed to the successful fusion of science, technology, and aesthetics, offering a permanent replacement that closely mimics the natural tooth.\n\n\n## Unlocking the Secrets of Dental Implants in McLean, VA\n\n\nUnderstanding the world of dental surgery can be complex, especially when the focus is on dental implants. Dental surgery is a broad term that encapsulates a variety of procedures. These include wisdom teeth removal, root canals, and more technically advanced procedures such as dental implants. A dental implant procedure comprises several steps. The first involves a consultation and a complete oral check-up.\n\nNext, the tooth extraction and bone grafting process take place if necessary. The third phase involves the placement of the titanium post that simulates a tooth’s root. After healing, an abutment is placed, and the artificial tooth or crown is finally attached. Each step requires a high level of surgical precision, and the role of dental surgery is pivotal in ensuring successful outcomes. The increasing popularity of dental implants rests mainly on their bevy of benefits.\n\n\n## The Benefits and Considerations of Dental Implants\n\n\nApart from offering a natural look and feel, they provide excellent functionality, last a lifetime with proper care, and do not hamper speech like some denture solutions can. At the same time, the upfront cost of dental implants may be more than other tooth replacement solutions; their durability, comforts, and aesthetic advantages make them a cost-effective option in the long run. However, like all surgical procedures, dental implant surgeries come with certain risks and potential complications.\n\nOur team of skilled dental surgeons performs many dental implant surgeries each year. We emphasize patient safety, comfort, and satisfaction and are committed to using the latest tools and techniques.\n\n\n## Choosing the Right Practice for Your Dental Implant\n\n\nTherefore, choosing Dental Group of Tysons in McLean, VA, for your dental implant procedure means choosing a safe, reliable, and credible solution. As you prepare to embark on your dental implant journey, keep in mind that every surgical procedure requires adequate preparation. To ensure your results are successful, you must prioritize good oral hygiene pre- and post-surgery and attend all follow-up appointments.\n\nPrepare for the best when working with our doctor, Dr. Nahlah. You could also schedule an initial consultation to meet our team and learn more about the procedure.\n\nPrevPreviousIntegrating Treatment Dental Practices into Your Dental Implant Procedure\n\nNextDiscover the Promising World of Teeth Implants in McLean, VANext\n\n\n#### More To Explore\n\n\n\n### Unlock the Benefits of Dental Implants: Your Best Teeth Replacement Option\n\n\nTooth loss can become an unfortunate reality for many as we age. Thankfully, advancements in dental technology, like dental implants,\n\nRead More »\n\nOctober 26, 2024\n\n\n### Your Comprehensive Guide on Dental Implants: The Best Replacement of Tooth Solution\n\n\nDental implants in McLean, VA are small, and titanium posts are surgically placed in your jawbone underneath your gum line.\n\nOctober 20, 2024\n\n\n## You Are Welcome Here.\n\n\nSchedule your consultation today.\n\nFacebook Instagram Youtube Google\n\n\n#### Contact Us\n\n\nAddresses:\n\nTysons Corner\n\n7901 Jones Branch Dr., Suite 220\n\nMcLean, VA 22102\n\nNew Patients: (571) 619-9442\n\nCurrent Patients: (703) 448-3312\n\nAlexandria\n\n2855 Duke St,\n\nAlexandria, VA 22314\n\nNew Patients: (571) 410-3430\n\nCurrent Patients: (703) 940-5410\n\n\n#### Hours\n\n\nMonday: 8:00am – 5:00pm\n\nTuesday: 8:00am – 5:00pm\n\nWednesday: 8:00am – 5:00pm\n\nThursday: 8:00am – 5:00pm\n\nFriday: 8:00am – 2:00pm\n\nSaturday: Closed\n\nSunday: Closed\n\n\n#### Services\n\n\nAll-On-4® Implants\n\nCrowns & Bridges\n\n\n#### About Us\n\n\nMeet the Doctor\n\nAbout Us\n\nBefore & After Photos\n\n2025 Dr. Nahlah. All rights reserved",
